{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Moteur de pronostic football - API locale","version":"0.1.0"},"paths":{"/health":{"get":{"summary":"Health","operationId":"health_health_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HealthResponse"}}}}}}},"/leagues":{"get":{"summary":"Leagues","description":"Adresse en lecture seule (etape A13) : dit au client quels championnats\nle moteur couvre, lequel est utilise par defaut, et sous quels noms on\npeut les demander (aliases).","operationId":"leagues_leagues_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LeaguesResponse"}}}}}}},"/fixtures":{"get":{"summary":"Fixtures","operationId":"fixtures_fixtures_get","parameters":[{"name":"days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Days"}},{"name":"league","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"League"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/FixturesOkResponse"},{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LeagueNotAvailableResponse"},{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/QuotaExceededResponse"}],"title":"Response 200 Fixtures Fixtures Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/analyze":{"post":{"summary":"Analyze","description":"Deux facons de designer le match : fixture_id (prioritaire, ignore\nhome_team/away_team s'il est fourni), ou home_team/away_team (home_team\ndoit etre l'equipe qui recoit). league accepte le nom officiel, la cle\ninterne, ou n'importe quel surnom declare par GET /leagues (etape A16).\n\nOrdre : championnat, puis (si pas de fixture_id) noms d'equipes\n(unknown_team - A11), puis recherche du match par noms - aucu